，中考满分710分我只考了326分！连本市最差的高中都没考上，我妈不忍心我这么小就进入社会，让我读职中学点东西，要不然我现在连学都没的上，所以我才考虑一个月5k还需要陪睡的暑假工，想着在妈妈生日前为她准备一部手机当礼物，毕竟她省吃俭用供我读书已经五年没换手机了。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1944618165331497461"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-13T13:52:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1944394409673425072"],"id":"1944394409673425072","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":10041,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"呃。。谁懂 https://t.co/zJ5tbmsdDe","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1944394409673425072"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-13T11:37:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1944360594070540335"],"id":"1944360594070540335","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":11702,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不用在为了几千块大老远去陪别人睡觉了，我同学给我推荐了条路子夏日人流量大，我们准备去广场公园这种地方卖冰粉，食材网上也能提前准备，我觉得月入过w不是梦。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1944360594070540335"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-13T07:45:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1944302146050216283"],"id":"1944302146050216283","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":32600,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"当今男生宿舍现状真的是这样吗？ https://t.co/kqezqeKWHt","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1944302146050216283"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-13T05:09:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1944262943094583801"],"id":"1944262943094583801","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4745,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"对于多年失眠的我来说，手冲助眠是骗局！冲完根本不会困，只会越来越精神，甚至还想再来一次，更耽误时间根本没用。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1944262943094583801"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-12T14:56:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1944048288770273722"],"id":"1944048288770273722","public_metrics":{"bookmark_co